  "job_B3.4.2_20251003_114735": {
    "text": "Men \u00fea leofeste, sanctus Matheus \u00fee godspellere, \u00fee \u00f0is godspel wrat, s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee H\u00e6lend spec to his\n& cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00f0a gyt \u00fe\u00e6t summe \u00fea \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6r weron ne sceolden dea\u00fe\u00e6s onfon \u00e6r \u00feam \u00fee heo segen hine sylfen\n\u00d0a embe six niht \u00e6fter \u00fean \u00fee Crist heom \u00feas word s\u00e6de, he nom mid him \u00fea his \u00fereo leorningcniht\u00e6s,\n\u00dea feringe wear\u00f0 Cristes anseone swi\u00f0e wunderlice f\u00e6ger iworden beforen heom \u00ferym, swa \u00fe\u00e6t his\n\u00dea r\u00e6dlice \u00e6tsceawede him \u00fe\u00e6r Moyses \u00fee halg\u00e6 \u00fee \u00fee ifyrren worlde \u00e6r w\u00e6s for\u00f0f\u00e6ren & Heli\u00e6s \u00fee\nSona swa \u00fea halige \u00feein\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t wundor swa mycel is\u00e6gen, \u00fea s\u00e6de Petrus to Criste, Drihten, god is us\n\u00dea imong \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00feus speken \u00fea com \u00fe\u00e6r f\u00e6ringe swi\u00f0e beorht genip, vel mist,& heom ealle\nSon\u00e6 swa \u00fea Cristes \u00feeign\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t mycele wundor is\u00e6gen & \u00fea f\u00e6derlice stefne ih\u00e6rdon, \u00fea w\u00e6ren heo\n\u00d0a neahl\u00e6chede heom \u00fee Healend, & ran heom, & heom up ahof, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to heom, Aris\u00e6\u00f0 & ne\n\u00dea hyo heor\u00e6 eagen up ahof\u00e6n, & arison, \u00fea ne isegen heo neo\u00feer ne Moyses ne Helias, ne n\u00e6nne mon\n\u00dea \u00f0e heo eft ny\u00f0er of \u00f0are dune eoden, \u00fea bead Crist heom \u00fereom \u00fee \u00fea wunderlice sih\u00f0e isegen, \u00fe\u00e6t\nLeofe men, ure Drihten mid his agene wordum \u00feurh his halg\u00e6n godspellere us mun\u00e6\u00f0 & l\u00e6re\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we\n& is swi\u00f0e uncu\u00f0 \u00e6lce men, \u00e6g\u00fe\u00e6r ge rice ge \u00feam h\u00e6num, hu longe he \u00feisses l\u00e6nen lifes brucon mote.\nHw\u00e6t we nu iherdon hwylc wunder he \u00e6tywde his leorningcnihtes on \u00feissere gastlice isih\u00f0e; for\u00feam \u00fee\n\u00deeah \u00f0e godspellere \u00feas halige race mid lyt worde write, \u00feeahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere \u00fe\u00e6t blisse & \u00feeo murh\u00f0e \u00fee heo\n\u00d0e godspellere cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Crist wolde her on worlde sceawen his agene ansyne his leorningcniht\u00e6s swa\nWe sceolen gemun\u00e6n understonden \u00fe\u00e6t Crist s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee w\u00e6g is swi\u00f0e heah & swi\u00f0e st\u00e6ger \u00fee l\u00e6de\u00fe\nUten gemunen hw\u00e6t \u00fee apostol cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ure murh\u00fee, & ure wuldor, & ure blisse is on heofene.\nTo \u00feam murh\u00f0e & to \u00feam blisse we sceolen becumen \u00feurh Gode.\nWel \u00fe\u00e6t is is\u00e6id \u00fe\u00e6t Crist his halige \u00feein\u00e6s l\u00e6dde up on \u00fea heage dune onsundron: \u00fe\u00e6t tacn\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea\n\u00deenne bi\u00f0 ifylled \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0e witeg\u00e6 cw\u00e6\u00f0 on \u00feam psalme, Drihten, \u00feu bihuddest \u00feine halg\u00e6n on \u00feines\n\u00dee godspellere s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t Crist \u00e6fter six dagum fulde \u00fe\u00e6t he his \u00feeinum bihet, \u00fe\u00e6t heo his ansyne swi\u00f0e\nOn \u00feam is bitacn\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t alle halige sceolen \u00e6fter \u00feisse weorlde to \u00feam heofenlice blisse bicumen \u00fee \u00f0e\nWe r\u00e6de\u00f0 on bocum \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feissere weorlde tide stond\u00e6\u00fe on six ylde.\nNu beo\u00f0 \u00fee fiue for\u00f0 igan, & \u00feeo sixte is nu andweard.\nNu \u00e6fter \u00feonne \u00feeos ifylled bi\u00f0 & iendod, \u00feenne iher\u00e6\u00f0 alle halige ure Drihten & iseo\u00f0, & \u00feenne\nHwi s\u00e6de \u00fee godspellere \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes ansyne w\u00e6re scinend\u00e6 & swi\u00f0e wunderlic iworden, &\nFor \u00fean \u00fee \u00f0e H\u00e6lend wolde festnen & streng\u00e6n heore bileafe \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t isegen, & eac eft alr\u00e6 \u00feare \u00fee hit\nLeofe men, \u00e6r \u00feam \u00fee \u00f0e \u00e6reste men Adam & Eua agulten & Gode wre\u00f0\u00e6don on neorxnawong\u00e6, \u00e6r\nHit ilimp\u00f0 \u00feeah on \u00feissere weorlde endunge, on domes d\u00e6g, \u00fe\u00e6t God gyf\u00f0 heom \u00e6ft heor\u00e6 fulle\n\u00deenne underfeh\u00f0 \u00fee mone \u00feare sunne brihtnesse, & \u00feeo sunne bi\u00f0 seofen si\u00f0e brihtre \u00feenne heo nu is;\n\u00deis bi\u00f0 iworden, \u00feenne \u00fea tid cym\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea Godes bearn, \u00fe\u00e6t beo\u00f0 alle halige men, underfo\u00f0 eac reste\nNe m\u00e6g \u00feeah \u00feare tungl\u00e6 ne \u00feare haligr\u00e6 wlite & f\u00e6gernesse beon ilic Cristes beorhtnesse, for \u00fean \u00fee\nSanctus Paulus \u00fee apostol cw\u00e6\u00f0 be \u00feam Cristes halg\u00e6n, Efne swa \u00fee steor\u00e6 oferscin\u00e6\u00f0 o\u00f0erne on\nSwylc bi\u00f0 \u00fee mon \u00e6rest on domes d\u00e6ge swa mucele wundorlycor & brihtr\u00e6 \u00feenne he \u00feer scin\u00e6\u00f0 for\nFor \u00feam swa mycele mare swa \u00f0e mon her on weorlde to gode de\u00fe toforen \u00feam o\u00f0re & swa mucel swa\nHw\u00e6t we wit\u00e6n so\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0e wlite & \u00feeo fegernesse \u00feare drihtenlice ansyne feor oferstih\u00f0 \u00feare\nAc \u00feeah, swa ic \u00e6r s\u00e6de, \u00fee wlite & \u00feeo fegernesse Cristes ansyne alle \u00feare sunne beorhtnesse\n\u00de\u00e6sne wlite, & \u00feis wuldor \u00feare drihtenlice ansyne ne mot nan sunful mon iseon, ac \u00fe\u00e6t togescead bi\u00f0\nEalle we sceolon on \u00feam d\u00e6ge, gode & yfele, on ure Drihten loki\u00e6n; ac ne bi\u00f0 \u00feenne nan deofles mon\nAc \u00fea synfulle men sceolen iseon \u00fea wund\u00e6n & \u00fea sar on ure Drihtne & \u00fe\u00e6re n\u00e6gl\u00e6 swa\u00f0e, \u00fee he\n\u00d0onne ne magen \u00fea Cristes halg\u00e6n nenne d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s sares ne \u00feare wund\u00e6 on \u00feam drihtenlice lichame\n\u00d0enne on domes d\u00e6g wur\u00f0 geiscead atwa, alle so\u00f0feste men & synfull\u00e6: \u00feenne \u00e6fter \u00feam beo\u00f0 \u00fea\nBe \u00feam s\u00e6de \u00f0e apostol, Drihten gehyw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea eadmodnesse ures lichames, & hine gede\u00fe wlitigne ant\nHw\u00e6t s\u00e6cge we \u00fe\u00e6t his cla\u00fe\u00e6s tacnoden \u00fee \u00f0e godspellere bis\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t heo w\u00e6ren iworden swa hwite\nSo\u00felice \u00fea g\u00e6dering bi\u00f0 hwit iworden \u00feurh fulluhtes b\u00e6\u00f0e, & heo scin\u00e6\u00f0 hwite & brihte beforen\nW\u00e6l we witen \u00fe\u00e6t nis nan mon \u00fee hine wi\u00f0 alle synnen healden mage \u00fea hwile \u00fe\u00e6t he her on weorlde\nAc \u00feeah hit iwur\u00f0 \u00e6t \u00feisre weorlde endunge on domes d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten his halg\u00e6 la\u00feung & alle halige\n\u00dee godspellere s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6r \u00e6teowden Moyses & Heli\u00e6s, & \u00fe\u00e6r wi\u00f0 Drihtin speken.\nLeofe men, hwylce sawedon heo heom?\nO\u00f0\u00f0e hw\u00e6t specon heo to him?\nLucas \u00fee godspellere hit s\u00e6g\u00f0 gyt cy\u00f0licor.\nHe s\u00e6g\u00f0, Moyses & Helias w\u00e6ron is\u00e6gene on \u00ferymme & on wuldre, & heo specon to Criste embe his\nHw\u00e6t tacn\u00e6\u00f0 Moyses & Helias \u00fea \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6rup on \u00f0\u00e6re dune wi\u00f0 Drihten specon embe his \u00ferowunge\n& God heom unwreah alle \u00fea \u00f0ing \u00f0e towearde weron, \u00e6rest bi Cristes tocyme hider on midd\u00e6neard,\nButon tweon all \u00feis sceal iwur\u00f0\u00e6n.\nWiterlice eac Moyses \u00feurh \u00feas men tacnedo hu he mennisce dea\u00fe underfeng, & for\u00f0ferde & iburiged\nRihtlice \u00fea men magen beon \u00feurh Moyses bitacnod, \u00fea \u00f0e nu on domes d\u00e6g of dea\u00fee aris\u00e6\u00f0 & \u00e6r\nEli\u00e6s n\u00e6fre gyt dea\u00fe ne \u00feolode, ac he is gyt on lichame libbende on \u00feam stowe \u00fee God him h\u00e6f\u00f0 is\u00e6t:\nRihtlice \u00fea men beo\u00f0 \u00feurh Helias itacnode, \u00fea \u00fee nu \u00e6r domes d\u00e6g libbende beo\u00f0 imette.\nEalle men \u00e6g\u00fe\u00e6r \u00fea \u00f0e \u00e6r for\u00f0iwitene w\u00e6ron, ge \u00fea \u00f0e \u00feenne on lichame libbende beo\u00f0, sceolen beon\nLeof\u00e6 men, we sceolen \u00e6fre mid \u00feankiende mode understonden & \u00feencen hw\u00e6t \u00fee heofenlice Kyng\nFor ylc mon swa he mare lufe h\u00e6f\u00f0 to \u00feam Almihtig\u00e6 Gode, swa him lust swi\u00f0or \u00fee lufe; & a swa\nFor \u00feam sanctus Petrus \u00fea \u00f0e he Cristes ansyne swa briht & swa wlitige iseah & \u00fe\u00e6t wuldor \u00feare\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he for \u00feon, Drihten, god is us \u00fe\u00e6t we her beon, gyf \u00feu wult \u00fe\u00e6t we her wurchen \u00fereo\nSanctus Petrus w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e mid \u00feam wuldre ofercumen \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6r iseah, \u00fe\u00e6t he for \u00feon ne \u00feohte hw\u00e6t\nNe bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r on \u00feare heahe eadignesse sundries huses neod, be \u00feam s\u00e6de sanctus Iohannes \u00fee apostol,\n\u00dea he \u00fea heofenlice eadignesse iseah & sceawode, \u00fea s\u00e6de he fel\u00e6 \u00feing\u00e6 bi \u00feare fegernesse \u00fee he\n\u00dea s\u00e6de he, Ne seah ic \u00fe\u00e6r nan temple, ne nan sundrie hus; ac Drihten sylf is \u00feare ceastre & \u00fe\u00e6s\nAc \u00feeah sanctus Petrus \u00fe\u00e6t word mearcode, \u00feeah he mid \u00feam wuldre ofercumen w\u00e6re, \u00fea he s\u00e6de,\n\u00d0a \u00f0e sanctus Petrus Cristes ansyne iseah swa briht, & swa wlitig, & \u00fe\u00e6t wuldor \u00feare twegr\u00e6 monn\u00e6\nHw\u00e6t secg\u00e6 we, leof\u00e6 men, hwylc eadignesse underfo\u00f0 \u00fea men, \u00fee nu mid gode d\u00e6de earn\u00e6\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t\nHwylc mon is \u00fe\u00e6t mid worde s\u00e6cg\u00e6n mag\u00e6, o\u00f0\u00f0e mid mode \u00feencean, hu mycele, & hu monifealde\n& na \u00fe\u00e6t an \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00fe\u00e6r tw\u00e6gr\u00e6 monn\u00e6 wuldor iseon swa swa Petrus & his feren dudon uppon \u00feare\n\u00de\u00e6r h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00e6lc to o\u00f0re unasecgendlic luf\u00e6, & ylc bliss\u00e6\u00fe on o\u00f0res gode & on o\u00f0res murh\u00f0e, swa on his\n\u00d0a sanctus Petrus \u00feas word \u00feus to Criste spec, \u00fea com \u00fe\u00e6r fering\u00e6 swi\u00f0e briht wolcn & heom alle\nFor mucele arfestnesse Crist sceawde his leorningcniht\u00e6s \u00fea godcunde sih\u00f0e, for \u00feon \u00fee he geare\n\u00dea wolde he for \u00feon her on worlde heor\u00e6 bileaf\u00e6 festlycor trymmen & heom cu\u00fean, mid \u00feam\n\u00dea halig men for heor\u00e6 mennisce tydernesse ne mihten \u00fe\u00e6t wuldor aberon, ac heo feollen on \u00fea eor\u00f0e.\n\u00dea dude Crist swa \u00fee arfeste treowe lar\u00feeow don sceal, \u00e6g\u00feer ge heom mid his honden up ar\u00e6rde, &\n\u00dea \u00fee heo heor\u00e6 eag\u00e6n up ahofen, \u00fea ne is\u00e6gen heo \u00fe\u00e6r nenne mon buton Crist ane, ac w\u00e6s \u00feeo\n\u00d0a \u00fee heo ny\u00f0er of \u00feam dune eoden \u00fee Thabor hatte, \u00fea bead Crist heom \u00fe\u00e6t heo nane men \u00fe\u00e6t\nFor hwon forbeat Crist his \u00feeignum \u00fe\u00e6t heo ne sceolden cu\u00fe\u00e6n ne s\u00e6cg\u00e6n nane men \u00fe\u00e6t brihtlice\n\u00de\u00e6t o\u00f0er is for\u00fean \u00fee he wiste, gif hit \u00feam folce is\u00e6d w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t all \u00fe\u00e6t folc were \u00feenne \u00fee mycele\nAc \u00fea nolde Crist \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0e halge geleaf\u00e6 \u00fee \u00feam monnum \u00feurh his blod, & \u00feurh his \u00f0rowunge sceolde\n\u00deenne w\u00e6s hit eac for o\u00f0re \u00feinge \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00fea sih\u00f0e s\u00e6cgan ne mosten.\nFor \u00feam gyf hit \u00feenne sone monnum cy\u00fe w\u00e6re, \u00feenne w\u00e6re monig mon \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t to his ileafen \u00e6rest\nAc he wiste \u00fe\u00e6t hit \u00feuhte eft \u00e6fter \u00feam monige tyddrum modum swi\u00f0e egeslic \u00feenne heo his hearde\n\u00dea wolde he for\u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t heo abiden \u00fe\u00e6s s\u00e6les, hw\u00e6nne hit ware monnum nytlicost to cu\u00fe\u00e6nne & to\nHe wolde \u00fe\u00e6t his halige \u00ferowung \u00e6r ifulled w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t eft his halige apostolas \u00e6fter \u00feam \u00fee heo mid\nNu, leof\u00e6 men, we habb\u00e6\u00f0 is\u00e6d eow be summe d\u00e6le \u00fe\u00e6s godspellice word.\nUten we nu mid alle ure heorte, & mid alle ure m\u00e6gne, cyrren to ure Drihten & earni\u00e6n mid gode\n& gyf we wull\u00e6\u00f0 lufi\u00e6n \u00fe\u00e6t we iseon moten ure Drihtines ansyne swa wundorlic & swa wlitig, \u00feonne",
